{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53520","headline":"小庭水植率尔成诗 · 钱徽","name":"小庭水植率尔成诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泓然一缶水，下与㘭堂接。\n青菰八九枝，圆荷四五叶。\n动摇香风至，顾盼野心惬。\n行可采芙蓉，长江讵云涉。\n（见钱仲联《韩昌黎诗系年集释》卷九《奉和钱七兄曹长盆池所植》附）（按：宋方崧卿《韩集举正》卷三云：「钱徽也。\n唐本具钱诗於前。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱徽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53520.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53520","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}